":"video:cmu3ggxym000abn5k4p9zb5of","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"description_text","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"【鐵路鑽深啲👷古洞站機電之旅 #1】🎤幾多對 持續愛到幾多歲🎵鐵仔喺北環綫項目下嘅東鐵綫古洞站地盤發現「天梯」？！ 呢啲吊喺半空中嘅「天梯」🏗️ 其實係將來連接古洞站地面層、大堂層同月台層嘅扶手電梯！喺上年11月車站平頂之後，我哋全速喺站入面進行機電工程，電梯安裝就係其中一個重要工序💪 💡體型龐大、每節最重可達到7噸嘅扶手電梯逐節「從天而降」，分段咁吊運到大堂層，然後就好似砌積木咁喺站內組裝，而古洞站總共12條扶手電梯已經完美「降落」喇，完成組件嘅裝嵌喇！呢個機電「旅程」仍然進行中，向出年投入服務嘅目標前進！ #新鐵路建設無限未來 #東鐵綫古洞站 #北環綫 #機電工程 [Railway 101👷🏼‍♂️E&M Journey of Kwu Tung Station #1] T Chai spotted the “sky ladders” at the Kwu Tung Station construction site under the Northern Link project! These “sky ladders” 🏗️hanging in mid air are actually the future escalators that will connect the ground, concourse and platform levels of Kwu Tung Station. After the station was topped out last November, we began full-speed E&M works inside the station, and escalator installation is one of the major tasks. 💪 💡 Each escalator section is huge and weighs up to 7 tonnes. They are lifted by tower cranes on site and lowered piece by piece into the concourse level. Then, just like assembling building blocks, the team puts them together inside the station. All 12 escalators for Kwu Tung Station have now successfully “landed”! The E&M “journey” is still ongoing as we move steadily toward the station’s opening next year! #NewRailwaysGoBeyondBoundaries #KwuTungStationOnEastRailLine #NorthernLink","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3ggxym000abn5k4p9zb5of:0004","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3ggxym000abn5k4p9zb5of","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"author_metadata","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"{\"displayName\": \"MTR Hong Kong\"}","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","bra